}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToBasisAfterSimp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">addToBasisAfterSimp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToBasisAfterSimp","kind":"def","line":355,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToBasisAfterSimp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L355-L360"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyBasis\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplifyBasis</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplifies the basis using `c`. Every equation that `c` rewrites is removed from the basis\nand requeued in its rewritten form.\n\nSee **Note** at `EqCnstr.simplify` for why `checkCoeffDvd` must be enabled here.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyBasis","kind":"def","line":319,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyBasis","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L319-L353"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.toMonic\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">toMonic</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Tries to convert the leading monomial into a monic one.\n\nIt exploits the fact that given a polynomial with leading coefficient `k`,\nif the ring has a nonzero characteristic `p` and `gcd k p = 1`, then\n`k` has an inverse.\n\nIt also handles the easy case where `k` is `-1`.\n\nRemark: if the ring implements the class `NoNatZeroDivisors`, then\nthe coefficients are divided by the gcd of all coefficients.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.toMonic","kind":"def","line":288,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.toMonic","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L288-L317"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.superposeWith\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">superposeWith</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.superposeWith","kind":"def","line":278,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.superposeWith","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L278-L286"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToQueue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">addToQueue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToQueue","kind":"def","line":266,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.addToQueue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L266-L276"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.addToBasisCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">addToBasisCore</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.addToBasisCore","kind":"def","line":259,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.addToBasisCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L259-L264"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyAndCheck\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplifyAndCheck</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplifies and checks whether the resulting constraint is trivial (i.e., `0 = 0`),\nor inconsistent (i.e., `k = 0` where `k % c != 0` for a comm-ring with characteristic `c`),\nand returns `none`. Otherwise, returns the simplified constraint.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyAndCheck","kind":"def","line":239,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyAndCheck","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L239-L249"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.checkConstant\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkConstant</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if `c.p` is the constant polynomial.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.checkConstant","kind":"def","line":208,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.checkConstant","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L208-L237"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplify\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplify</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplify the given equation constraint using the current basis.\n\n**Note**: This function (and `simplifyBasis`) runs with `checkCoeffDvd := true`. Unless the\nring implements `NoNatZeroDivisors`, rewriting a monomial `k'*m'` using an equation with\nleading term `k*m` must not multiply the equation by `k/gcd k k' ≠ ±1`: *replacing* an\nequation with the result loses information, since `p = 0` cannot be recovered from\n`(k/gcd k k') * p = 0` in an arbitrary commutative ring. Thus, the rewrite eliminates `k'*m'`\nif `k ∣ k'`, performs a Euclidean remainder step (`k' = q*k + r`, the equation is never\nmultiplied by a constant) if `|k| < |k'|`, and is skipped otherwise. For example, `3*x = 0` is\nrewritten into `x = 0` using `2*x = 0`. The consequences of the skipped rewrites are not lost:\na skipped rewrite at the leading monomial coincides with the S-polynomial computed by\n`superposeWith`, so it is derived non-destructively. Reduction is still an incomplete\nideal-membership test in rings without `NoNatZeroDivisors`. The complete alternative is a\nstrong Gröbner basis over `Int` (Kandri-Rody & Kapur), which additionally superposes\ngcd-polynomials (Bézout combinations producing `gcd k k'` times the lcm of the leading\nmonomials).\n\n**Note**: If using `withCheckCoeffDvd` becomes too expensive when one does not have\n`NoNatZeroDivisors`, we will add a flag to perform the simplification anyway even if\ninformation is lost.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplify","kind":"def","line":175,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplify","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L175-L206"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyUsingNumEq0\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplifyUsingNumEq0</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyUsingNumEq0","kind":"def","line":170,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyUsingNumEq0","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L170-L173"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyWithExhaustively\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">EqCnstr</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplifyWithExhaustively</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">c₂</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplifies `c₁` using `c₂` exhaustively.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyWithExhaustively","kind":"opaque","line":165,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyWithExhaustively","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L165-L168"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr.simplifyWith\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind<