ass=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">PolyDerivation</span>.<span class=\"name\">simplifyWith</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.PolyDerivation\">PolyDerivation</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.PolyDerivation\">PolyDerivation</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplifies `d.p` using `c`, and returns an extended polynomial derivation.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.PolyDerivation.simplifyWith","kind":"def","line":125,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.PolyDerivation.simplifyWith","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L125-L130"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.findSimp?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">Poly</span>.<span class=\"name\">findSimp?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly\">Poly</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `some c`, where `c` is an equation from the basis whose leading monomial divides some\nmonomial in `p`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.findSimp?","kind":"def","line":113,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.findSimp?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L113-L123"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Mon.findSimp?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mon</span>.<span class=\"name\">findSimp?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Mon\">Mon</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `some c`, where `c` is an equation from the basis whose leading monomial divides `m`.\nRemark: if `checkCoeffDvd` is enabled and the current ring does not satisfy the property\n```\n∀ (k : Nat) (a : α), k ≠ 0 → OfNat.ofNat (α := α) k * a = 0 → a = 0\n```\nthen the absolute value of the leading coefficient of the equation must not exceed `|k|`.\nThis ensures the rewrite is monic (i.e., `k₁ = 1` at `PolyDerivation.step`): it eliminates\nthe monomial if the leading coefficient divides `k`, and it is a Euclidean remainder step\notherwise. See `Poly.simpM?`.\n\nAmong the candidates, it prefers equations whose leading coefficient divides `k`, and then\nequations with fewer terms. Such an equation eliminates the monomial with `k₁ = 1`. Otherwise,\nthe rewrite is a remainder step, or, if `checkCoeffDvd` is disabled, it has `k₁ ≠ 1` and proves\nonly `k₁ * lhs = rhs`, which is weaker in rings without `NoNatZeroDivisors`. Fewer terms keep\nintermediate polynomials small.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Mon.findSimp?","kind":"def","line":81,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.Mon.findSimp?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L81-L111"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.mkEqCnstr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkEqCnstr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly\">Poly</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstrProof\">EqCnstrProof</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.mkEqCnstr","kind":"def","line":47,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.mkEqCnstr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/EqCnstr.lean#L47-L51"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.DenoteExpr","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.Inv","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.Proof","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.Reify","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingId","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.SafePoly","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Diseq"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.CommRing.EqCnstr"}